      "id": 52019,
      "name": "Cosmonaut Zero",
      "username": "Cosmonaut_Zero",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/cosmonaut_zero/{size}/2520_2.png",
      "created_at": "2013-01-12T23:05:43.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"XChylde\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/xchylde/48/2559_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> XChylde:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Correct, you cannot use the same power twice in a round regardless of how it is activated.&nbsp;</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>To be precise, it's once per <em>turn</em>, not once per round. If you have an abilty that lets another hero activate a power on your turn (e.g. Argent Adept or an incapacitated power) they can activate a power that they already activaed on their turn.</p>",
